<view class="page">
  <view class="hero"><text class="eyebrow">可迁移 · 可恢复 · 不上云</text><text class="title">把数据掌握在自己手里</text><text class="subtitle">完整 ZIP 包含菜谱、图片、标签和推荐历史，不包含 API Key 与诊断日志。</text></view>

  <view class="summary card"><view><text class="summary-value">{{recipeCount}}</text><text>本地菜谱</text></view><view><text class="summary-value">{{imageCount}}</text><text>菜品图片</text></view><view><text class="summary-value">{{historyCount}}</text><text>推荐记录</text></view></view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="eyebrow">完整备份</text><text class="section-title">导出 ZIP</text>
    <label class="field"><text class="field-label">文件名</text><input class="input" value="{{filename}}" bindinput="filenameInput" /></label>
    <button class="button-primary" disabled="{{exporting}}" bindtap="exportBackup">{{exporting ? '正在导出…' : '生成 ZIP 备份'}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{progress}}" class="notice">{{progress}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{exportResult}}" class="notice success-notice"><text>已生成 {{exportResult.filename}}</text><text class="path">{{exportResult.size}} 字节 · {{exportResult.imageCount}} 张图片</text><button class="button-secondary" bindtap="shareBackup">分享 / 保存到文件</button></view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="eyebrow">安全恢复</text><text class="section-title">导入 ZIP</text>
    <text class="muted description">先校验结构和版本，再预览冲突。写入失败时自动恢复原数据。</text>
    <button class="button-secondary" disabled="{{importing}}" bindtap="chooseImport">{{importing ? '正在处理…' : '从聊天或文件中选择 ZIP'}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{preview}}" class="import-preview">
      <text class="preview-title">校验通过：{{preview.manifest.recipeCount}} 道菜谱</text>
      <text class="muted">创建于 {{preview.manifest.createdAt}}，包含 {{preview.manifest.imageFiles.length}} 张图片，{{preview.conflicts}} 条 ID 冲突。</text>
      <label class="field"><text class="field-label">冲突处理</text><picker range="{{conflictOptions}}" value="{{conflictIndex}}" bindchange="conflictChange"><view class="picker-box">{{conflictOptions[conflictIndex]}}</view></picker></label>
      <view class="button-row"><button class="button-ghost" bindtap="cancelImport">取消</button><button class="button-primary" bindtap="confirmImport">确认导入</button></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card danger-zone"><text class="section-title">清理本机数据</text><text class="muted">只影响当前微信和当前设备，不影响你已经导出的备份。</text><button class="button-danger" bindtap="clearData">清空菜谱与推荐历史</button></view>
</view>
